Put the free ISE WebPACK license file here as: Xilinx.lic

Generate it at https://www.xilinx.com/getlicense (AMD account):
  - "Create New License" -> ISE WebPACK / free WebPACK license
  - Host ID type: Ethernet Address (MAC)
  - Host ID: 08:00:27:68:c9:35   (the virtual MAC used by bin/ise-run;
    override with ISE_LICENSE_MAC if you use a different one)
Then download the .lic file and save it as Xilinx.lic in this directory.

bin/ise-run mounts it into the container automatically when present.
